  "notes": "tanpura 'नमस्कार' se 0.25 s pehle band, dono beds usse pehle out; host intro aur 'Chaliye.' ke baad 1.3 s kuch bhi nahi, phir body. Cold open ke andar teen jagah jaan-boojh kar koi cue nahi: (1) 'registaan … daaku bhi … uska naam Bharat hai' — raasta bataaya gaya hai, tay nahi kiya gaya; (2) 'ise pi lo' aur 'Wo pyala peeta hai' — koi ghoont nahi, koi pyala nahi; (3) pothi ki sarsaraahat ke baad se tanpura ke entry tak — 'gyaan dhoondhne aaya tha' wali dono lines chup-chaap chalti hain."
 }
